# An allowlist: Go sources, module files and the files they embed (go:embed).
# A new embed outside these paths must be added here. Exclusions name files
# (dir/**): a directory already excluded by * does not re-exclude them.
*
!**/*.go
!**/go.mod
!**/go.sum
!internal/migrations/**
!internal/media/workqueue/migrations/**
!media/avatar/avatar.png
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/**
**/node_modules/**
benchmarks/**
sdk/**
tests/**
